[00:00.00] 作词 : David Wen Wei Liang
[00:00.00][by:VaporRoxie]
[00:00.70] 作曲 : David Wen Wei Liang
[00:10.77]Something in the way you’re drifting
[00:10.77]在你漂流的路上
[00:16.21]Something I don’t understand
[00:16.21]我有些不解
[00:21.50]When you’re always on the run, life can’t be much fun
[00:21.50]当你不停奔波时，生活就没有多大乐趣了
[00:27.00]Yet the running never ends
[00:27.00]然而你从不停止奔波
[00:32.20]You never seem to turn the corner
[00:32.20]你似乎永远不会转弯
[00:37.51]Almost back where you began
[00:37.51]几乎回到原点
[00:42.77]You’re curious like a child, wandering the wild
[00:42.77]你在荒野漂流，好奇得像个孩子
[00:48.38]Never sure where you might land
[00:48.38]永远不确定会在哪里着陆
[00:53.38]Now you’re lost, all alone
[00:53.38]现在你迷路了，形影相吊
[00:58.44]And there’s no place in the world left to turn
[00:58.44]在这世界上走投无路
[01:03.79]But I will take you
[01:03.79]我会收留你
[01:09.35]When you need a place to stay
[01:09.35]当你需要栖息之地
[01:14.43]If you want shelter
[01:14.43]如果你需要避难所
[01:19.95]Come in out of the rain
[01:19.95]就来躲避风雨
[01:24.50]And you can call me home
[01:24.50]你可以叫我回家
[01:31.57]Something in your voice is cracking
[01:31.57]你有些破音
[01:36.68]A sound that I can barely hear
[01:36.68]几乎听不清你的声音
[01:41.73]When there’s so much to withstand, your will begins to bend
[01:41.73]当你遭遇了这么多时，你的意志开始动摇
[01:47.39]And confidence reduced to fear
[01:47.39]从踌躇满志变成战战兢兢
[01:52.25]You look down, pushed around
[01:52.25]你眉眼低垂，任人摆布
[01:57.61]When there’s no place in this world left to go
[01:57.61]当你在这世上走投无路时
